      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">γ</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">γ</mi></mrow></msubsup></math>",
